pwl: hold before the first point, delay, the periodic law
model vsource vsource
v1 (a 0) vsource type="pwl" wave=[1u, 1, 2u, 3]
v2 (b 0) vsource type="pwl" wave=[1u, 1, 2u, 3] delay=1u
v3 (c 0) vsource type="pwl" wave=[0, 0, 1u, 1] period=2u
v4 (d 0) vsource type="pwl" wave=[1u, 1, 2u, 3] period=4u
v5 (e 0) vsource type="pwl" wave=[1u, 1, 2u, 3] period=4u delay=1u
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  analysis op1 op
  analysis tr1 tran stop=9u step=1n maxstep=5n
endc
